    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reading timetables",
     "texto": [
      "**Rutetabell** is the published timetable of a route; **avgang** is the departure and **ankomst** the arrival.",
      "**Reisetid** shows how long the journey takes. In Norwegian, the time is usually expressed with **klokka** followed by the hour: **klokka ni** («at nine»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
